  <content>
  <section><title>Cool Down Activity</title>
<para>The equation \(p=5,000\cdot2^t\) represents the population of an invasive fish species in a large lake, \(t\) years since 2005, when the fish population in the lake was first surveyed. Use the '^' symbol to enter an exponent.</para>

<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>What was the population in 2005?</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> 5,000, because \(5,000\cdot 2^0=5,000\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> What is this value of the population in 2005 in scientific notation?</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> \(5.0\times 10^3\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> For this model, what does it mean when \(t\) is –2?</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> It means 2 years before 2005, which is 2003.</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> For \( t=-2\), is the fish population more or less than 1,000? How do you know?</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>More than 1,000. For \(t=-2\) yeilds \(5,000\cdot 2^{-2}=1,250\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->


<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> Write the value of the fish population when \(t=-2\) in scientific notation.</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> \(1.25\times 10^3
      \)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End --></section>
